{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":12,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"7e95cbc1-e456-4b04-b591-92f54d461237","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":390874593,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"储能系统集成工程师(J12201)","OrgId":3730450,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、负责电网侧、新能源配储储能项目系统集成方案设计，完成系统拓扑、设备选型，输出系统方案、BOM、技术规格书。 \n2、依据并网标准开展方案涉网合规校核，拆解客户技术协议，编制招采相关技术文档；参与项目可行性分析，识别基础技术风险。 \n3、对接设计院、设备供应商开展技术交流、方案评审；完成投标技术应答、技术文档编制。 \n4、跟进 FAT 出厂测试、SAT 现场验收，参与调试及并网联调，处理一般性系统集成问题，重大风险向上汇报。 \n5、初创阶段附加工作：参与项目前期调研、实证测试相关技术支撑，沉淀基础技术资料，接受短期出差。","Require":"必备要求 \n1、本科及以上，电气工程、电力系统、电力电子相关专业；2年以上储能系统集成相关经验，完整参与至少 1-2 个表前大储或新能源配储落地项目。 \n2、熟悉储能整站系统架构，理解 PCS/BMS/EMS 交互逻辑；了解储能并网、涉网基本要求，能读懂一二次电气图纸，会使用 CAD。 \n3、可以独立完成常规项目方案与文档输出，能够对接供应商闭环技术问题，具备系统思维，非单一模块专职人员。 \n4、能够接受短期项目出差，适配小团队多任务工作模式。\n优先条件（非必须，满足其一即可） \n1、参与过储能电站实证测试； \n2、了解 35kV 升压站系统边界； \n3、有锂电以外的储能相关调研或项目经历。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-21T14:56:54.6627133","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliv