0)","OrgId":3730463,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"-","Require":"硬性条件：\n1.本科及以上学历，电气工程、新能源、材料学等专业优先；\n2.具备较强结构化思维与表达、谈判、逻辑分析及跨部门协作能力，具备较强的抗压性、责任心，高度认同公司文化与价值观。\n3.岗位方向：项目管理、售前支持-集中式、售中支持-海外、项目交付、售后支持-海外\n优秀25、26届毕业生也可投递\n\n加分项：\n1.在校期间曾担任主要学生干部职务，或有学生会经历；\n2.海外技术支持需具备优秀的英语听说读写能力，小语种优势优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-26T17:40:54","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"81d7be9a-bd03-4db5-8a27-3466927161db","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":390858845,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"通威校招生-可靠性研究岗(J12039)","OrgId":3730452,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、负责太阳能电池、组件产品可靠性研究及判定标准开发，失效机理分析及模型建立；\n2、负责研发新项目的可靠性/系统实证测试统筹规划；\n3、负责光伏产品发电系统性能研究、储能电子技术研究；\n4、负责行业前沿测试标准的分析研究；\n5、负责研究数据分析整理、报告撰写、专利撰写。","Require":"1、硕士及以上学历，物理类、化学类、材料学类、机械类等相关专业；了解光伏电池、组件的工作原理、结构组成和功能特性。\n2、CET-6，具备良好英文文献查找和阅读能力。\n3、熟练操作表征设备、测试设备及仪器，具备模拟及建模技能，掌握各类测试分析工具及表征方法，能够使用软件进行数据整理和分析、输出报告。\n4、具备良好的学习能力及抗压能力，责任心强，能够有效沟通协调资源，推动项目高效开展。\n5、具备独立完成一般性科学技术工作的能力，能较好运用新技术、新工艺，处理本专业范围内一般性技术难题。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-26T17:17:58","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"3940ee46-0744-45de-a6f6-40a9bf8a7b00","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":390858840,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"通威校招生-组件材料研发岗(J12038)","OrgId":3730452,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、负责新产品、新技术、新材料开发过程中的产品性能评估和分析；\n2、负责组件高效新技术材料的开发、测试评估、工艺优化及导入；\n2、调研行业最新标准、技术文献，开展材料测试方法制定以及技术文件编制；\n4、研发关键项目子项协助开发、材料端工艺及性能优化，可靠性跟进评测；\n5、负责相关项目文献查阅，撰写相关专利及报告。","Require":"1、硕士及以上学历，物理类、材料类、光学工程等相关专业；\n2、CET-6，具备良好英文文献查找和阅读能力，核心期刊/SCI至少一篇及以上。\n3、具备实验设计及表征设备、器材的操作经验，能够使用分析软件进行数据处理和分析，输出报告。\n4、具备跨学科融合能力、创新与成果转换的能力；具备良好的抗压能力、沟通协作能力和解决问题的能力。\n5、具备独立完成一般性科学技术工作的能力。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"